Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.95,0:00:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来给你描绘一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me paint you a picture
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.14,0:00:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个没有怪物  没有恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a world without monsters or demons
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.49,0:00:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个再没有人会因为超自然生灵而死的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of a world where no one has to die because of the supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个新世界  一个更好的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of a new world, a better world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.05,0:00:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.46,0:00:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有我的把柄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no hold on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.25,0:00:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加文  跟爸爸打个招呼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin, honey, say hello to daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.22,0:00:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你怎么  -我知道些咒语  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you... - I know a spell or two, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他得回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get that he's got to go back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的命运是登上去美国的轮船\N{\fnArial\fs30}his destiny is to board a ship bound for America.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那艘船会在暴风雨中沉没  无人生还\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ship went down in a storm. All hands were lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,改变过去的任何一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}you change any one thing in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,造成的连锁反应会影响之后的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ripple effect impacts everything that follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Crowley!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.53,0:00:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱王子是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is a Prince of Hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是最古老的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The oldest of the old demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法亲自转化了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer turned them himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是受训将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were trained to be generals,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带领恶魔大军与天堂作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}to lead demonic armies in the war against Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.32,0:00:43.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像亚撒色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Azazel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.43,0:00:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们眼睛都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They even have his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.75,0:00:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道我们是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any idea who we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.94,0:00:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎  我不在乎你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care. I don't care who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.05,0:00:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至不在乎路西法要有娃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even care that Lucifer's got a bun in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妹妹大衮  她对此颇为关切\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister Dagon, she's taken an interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:00:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.21,0:01:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(麻萨诸塞州  安多弗)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(六个月前)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第12季第13集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.03,0:03:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  继续查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, stay on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.64,0:03:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有线索告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get any leads, you let us know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.87,0:03:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这边也会继续查\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll keep working it from our end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.81,0:03:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉·克莱恩还不知所踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Kelly Kline is in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.09,0:03:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.11,0:03:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-毫无踪迹  -太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No trace. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道路西法的孩子什么时候会出世\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea when Lucifer's kid is gonna pop,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许已经出世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it hasn't already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那么我们基本上什么都没查到  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So basically, we got nothin'. - Basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.67,0:03:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们还有别的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, we do have this other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.24,0:03:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What other thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来看看  爱荷华州得梅因一家博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out. Museum in Des Moines, Iowa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.64,0:03:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一名教师的尸体在停车场被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}A guy's body was found in the parking lot. A teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.14,0:03:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的舌头被拽了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}His tongue had been ripped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.65,0:03:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是因此致死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that didn't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但他死于内脏粉碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but having his internal organs crushed did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.21,0:03:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,躯干没有明显损伤  没有入口伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no obvious damage to the torso, no point of entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.85,0:03:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-巫师  -可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You thinkin' witch? - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他几小时前还活得好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he was seen alive just a couple hours earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在博物馆带学生参观\N{\fnArial\fs30}leading a student tour of the museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.30,0:03:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好久没见到妈妈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't seen Mom in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许她可以跟我们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she'll wanna work with us on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.15,0:04:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玩具不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.92,0:04:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gets the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.87,0:04:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  就是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothin', just, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在纽瓦克市外的一家旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm at a motel outside Newark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.73,0:04:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么特别的安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no special plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是付费电视  按摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, pay-per-view, magic fingers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.48,0:04:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好酒好菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}the uze.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你想到我  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's so sweet of you to think of me. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被拔舌啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tongue ripped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.41,0:04:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实雷米尔那档子事后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually still sort of resting up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没完全缓过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}after that whole Ramiel thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:04:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你们需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you need me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.72,0:05:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.01,0:05:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  那改日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, rain check.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是会撒谎  玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an excellent liar, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.99,0:05:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没跟我儿子说过我在跟你合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't told my sons I'm working with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看出来了  我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gathered, and I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩  不怎么喜欢我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean aren't our... biggest fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.27,0:05:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  因为你们折磨了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 'cause you, uh, tortured them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.19,0:05:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这事我们说过了  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've been through that. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是你  是你们的"乱来特工"\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't you, it was your, uh, "rogue operative."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.22,0:05:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.80,0:05:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你起初会抵抗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you'll resist, at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但羞辱感会侵蚀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the humiliation will eat at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.41,0:05:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到  最终\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until, finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彻底的无助感\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're worn down
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:05:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会击垮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}by your utter helplessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会喊我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will call me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.13,0:06:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你吹嘘自己无上的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brag of your superior power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.49,0:06:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天才比蛮力更胜一筹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, genius trumps brute force.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我找了十几个我最忠诚的手下去研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a dozen of my most loyal studying the cage
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.81,0:06:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在分子层级上关押你的笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you were held at the molecular level.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们成功复制了材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}They managed to replicate the material.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.14,0:06:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做了那些锁链\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made those chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.23,0:06:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把你弄到这儿来  就是另一码事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting you here...well, that was a different matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.35,0:06:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力  还是帮倒忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley, still not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们清楚自己在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we know what we're talking about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们查路西法很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have been on Lucifer's trail for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.43,0:06:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那房间里的每个人显然都专注于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody in the room was obviously focused
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.75,0:06:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用妈妈的咒语把你送回笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}on sending you back using Mother's spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody except yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.60,0:06:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗威娜  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我修改了咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I managed to pervert that spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让你的灵体没有被送回笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your essence wasn't sent back to the cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}but instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们几年前找到了你抛弃的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}we found your discarded vessel a few years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.59,0:07:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,修复了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}...repaired it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.67,0:07:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,改进了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}improved it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让它成为了适合真正的你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}making it a fitting final home
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.61,0:07:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最终归宿\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the real you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.99,0:07:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.02,0:07:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有坏坏的吐槽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No snarky, devilish comments?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你无话可说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have nothing to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.47,0:07:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.13,0:07:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如此费心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, all that effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你本可把我关回笼子里  但没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you could've had me back in the cage, but no,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想进行你可悲的小复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}you needed your sad, little revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这事会怎样结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think this is going to end?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:07:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  新家不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice new digs, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听好  看来还有一起凶杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this. It looks like there was another murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.15,0:08:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,类似我们要去看的那起\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just like the one we're checking up on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.89,0:08:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-爱荷华州吗  -不  麻萨诸塞州  安多弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Iowa? - No, Andover, Massachusetts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.81,0:08:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,六个月前  女性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six months ago. A woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尸体的状况是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Body was found in the same condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她貌似也是老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like she was a teacher, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜妈妈不能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad Mom couldn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.84,0:08:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说她太累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said she was too tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  就是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I just --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.30,0:08:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得她好像有什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like something's going on with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不肯说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she ain't talkin' about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈又猎魔了  这很辛苦的  你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom's hunting again. That's a grind. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.59,0:08:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她就是需要点时间而已  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just needs a little time, Dean. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.58,0:08:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(新英格兰沉船)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你们上皮尔森先生的车  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you're in Mr. Peterson's van, guys. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(爱荷华州  得梅因)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.34,0:08:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back out in one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(新英格兰沉船  明星号)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.14,0:10:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再次感谢你见我们  奥乔亚博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}So thank you ygain for meeting with us, Dr. Ochoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气  探员  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, Agent. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.79,0:10:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们两天内发生了两起杀人案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had two murders in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.07,0:10:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警方毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police have no idea what's going on, and --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们来了嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.79,0:10:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说第二名被害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you said victim number two brought some
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.80,0:10:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带童子军来参观了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timber Troopers through here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.42,0:10:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,16小时前他们就站在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}16 hours ago, they were standing right where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.75,0:10:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,博物馆来了什么新藏品吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything new to the museum?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here in the lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚开箱了三件巡回展品\N{\fnArial\fs30}three traveling exhibits have been uncrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.10,0:10:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一件已经摆出来了  另两个还在做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}One's already on display. The other two are being prepped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.78,0:10:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥乔亚博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Ochoa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-失陪  -没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.17,0:10:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.90,0:10:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,包括麻省的那名被害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}including the Massachusetts vic,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.04,0:10:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总共两个老师  一个童子军领队\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is two teachers and one scout leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是监督孩子的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People who supervise kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.58,0:10:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里挺闹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of action in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我改投鬼一票了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, I'm switching my vote from witch to ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,未必  博物馆有电磁场不是怪事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. EMF isn't that surprising at a museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里到处是不安分的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're always filled with ADHD spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和束缚他们的物件\N{\fnArial\fs30}and their tethers, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.21,0:11:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  如果凶犯是鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but if our killer is a chain rattler,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.92,0:11:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要怎么查明是哪一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}how we gonna figure out which one it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.43,0:11:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以点了吗  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就来点橙汁好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, just some orange juice, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.10,0:11:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小杯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.85,0:11:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候临盆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, when you due?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.68,0:11:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.29,0:11:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, take it from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.85,0:11:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生孩子前  你的人生是自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}before kids, your life is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.69,0:11:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等他们降生  你所熟悉的人生就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once they show up, life as you know it is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.05,0:11:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事应该就是这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure that's the way this is gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  等它出来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whenever it pops out,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对会爱上那个小坏蛋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're totally gonna love the little devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.73,0:12:02.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿芝特克人杀人不含糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aztecs were pretty serious about their killings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿芝特克鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aztec ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是一艘双桅帆船  明星号上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from a ship, um, a brigantine called The Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.73,0:12:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在新英格兰岸边因风暴沉没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunk in a storm off the New England coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是从一家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Currently on loan from
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海事博物馆借来的  听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Maritime Museum in -- wait for it --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.23,0:12:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是麻省  安多弗的博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andover, Massachusetts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.93,0:12:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-真的  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1723年沉没于风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunk in a storm in 1723.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  这个我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-wait a minute. I know something about something,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.71,0:12:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这艘船的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}about this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.11,0:12:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时它驶往新大陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was, uh, headed to the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.13,0:12:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,曾在苏格兰利斯停靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weighed anchor in Leith, Scotland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,利斯  对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leith. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.49,0:12:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加文·麦克劳德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin MacLeod.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.57,0:12:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-就是这艘船  -克劳力儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This was his ship. - Crowley's kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  就是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, it's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.56,0:13:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you -- you actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以为这样能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}you seriously think this is gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.07,0:13:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太可悲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.09,0:13:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你喜欢地板的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you like the taste of floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.43,0:13:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地上有一块需要擦干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a spot there needs scrubbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更糟的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.61,0:13:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你被打败时\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not even gonna see it comin'
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会措手不及\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you get taken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.28,0:13:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就凭你\N{\fnArial\fs30}By you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有我的骨血\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.53,0:13:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.26,0:13:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你记得那位可爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember the lovely...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.77,0:13:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉·克莱恩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly Kline?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.85,0:13:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她把孩子打掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got rid of that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.23,0:13:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.46,0:13:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,温家兄弟确保了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters saw to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.18,0:13:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你永远能信任他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they can always be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.21,0:13:48.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那对他们也有利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in their own self-interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.41,0:13:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.61,0:13:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我还能感觉到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I can still feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.05,0:13:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.93,0:13:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:00.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我有些骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of makes me proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.89,0:14:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天堂之光的后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chip off the old ball of heavenly light,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.09,0:14:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-什么事  -帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want? - Need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你...要我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...need...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和你弟弟白痴的表面下\N{\fnArial\fs30}that behind that whole moron facade,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.74,0:14:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是货真价实的白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and your brother are, in fact, morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们让路西法的私生子活了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let Lucifer's love child live.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you even know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.50,0:14:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要向你解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't owe you an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我猜现在不太合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so I'm -- I'm guessing this isn't the best time
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.40,0:14:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你联络加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ask you to get in touch with Gavin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.36,0:14:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们跟他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we can talk to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.60,0:14:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you out of your minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.87,0:14:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你让加文去生活在我们的时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you set Gavin free to live in our time
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可能搅和了余下的人类历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}and possibly screw up the rest of human history,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.33,0:14:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可没去追杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}we didn't hunt him down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.93,0:14:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你欠我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think you owe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和波波鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Bullwinkle
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趁那玩意破壳而出前  解决麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}fix this mess before it hatches.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.48,0:14:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后  或许我们还能谈谈我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, maybe then, we'll talk about my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.80,0:15:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这点  我们都是单身父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love that. You and I, both single fathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在挺需要关于当爹的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use a little Dad advice right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.78,0:15:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候允许孩子约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}When do you let 'em date?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(美国历史学会)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别推搡  女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pushing, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.88,0:15:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在大巴上要像在博物馆里一样文明礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's be as polite on the bus as we were in the museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.28,0:15:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同学们  不许占座\N{\fnArial\fs30}Class, no saving seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.59,0:15:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,车上不许吃东西  莎朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No food on the bus, Sharon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.05,0:15:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的故事太精彩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your little story's fascinating,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.02,0:15:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们说这事有我的好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you said there was something in this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.57,0:15:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果凶犯是鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the killer is a ghost,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.45,0:15:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它可能束缚在了船上的什么东西上\N{\fnArial\fs30}it may be tethered to something on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要关于船的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we need intel on the vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去办个图书证吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a library card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.06,0:15:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿肯色州的事  你俩还欠我人情呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two still owe me for helping you in Arkansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.77,0:16:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们认识一个有关于明星号第一手资料的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know of a guy who has firsthand knowledge of The Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you find him,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的有你会喜欢的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}we actually do have something that you'll like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.19,0:16:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, really like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.07,0:16:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个目击者是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this eyewitness?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.81,0:17:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离她远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.59,0:17:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是我们的  恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's ours, Demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-有令在身  -不关我事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Orders. - Not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.31,0:17:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.45,0:17:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.89,0:17:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想活命就跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me if you wanna live.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.93,0:17:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  你吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}I get it. You're freaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:18:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但深呼吸  冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}But take a breath. Chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.51,0:18:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你让那些人爆炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you made those people explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.52,0:18:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说一遍  他们不是人  而且他们在攻击你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again, not people. And they were attacking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you said you were a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.35,0:18:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,名号  标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}Titles, labels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个恶魔  你是罗斯玛丽  怀着孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a demon, you're Rosemary, complete with baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.41,0:18:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们被洗脑太深\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been fed so much propaganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主日学校是怎么讲路西法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they teach you about Lucifer at Sunday School?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.30,0:18:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜猜  干草叉  角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. Pitchforks? Horns?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.31,0:18:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们提过他是个大天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But did they mention he's an archangel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.03,0:18:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,曾是上帝最信任的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once one of God's most trusted?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.53,0:18:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道你的名字呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大衮  我叫大衮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dagon. It's Dagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我只是想说  这事不是黑白分明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, what I'm saying is it ain't all black and white,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.03,0:18:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非善即恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}good versus evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.35,0:18:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些想杀你的"人"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those "people" who were tryin' to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.68,0:18:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.23,0:18:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不像你想的那样是光晕加竖琴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not quite the harps and halos you thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.02,0:19:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么想杀你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why'd they want you dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.71,0:19:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你怀了一个无辜的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're carrying an innocent child.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.35,0:19:07.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别相信电影里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't believe what you see in the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.75,0:19:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人生来就有善恶  养育才是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one is born good or bad. It's all in the upbringing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个孩子  你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This child, your child...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可以拯救我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}he could save us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.39,0:19:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.35,0:19:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.89,0:19:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯莉  天使  温家兄弟  那些好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, the angels? The Winchesters? The good guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都想要你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.37,0:19:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我可以保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以保护你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can protect your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你再也不用逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.79,0:19:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他来了  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There he is. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:19:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.71,0:20:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  加文  见到你很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Gavin. Good to see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.75,0:20:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,21世纪的生活怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's life in the 21st century treatin' ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.52,0:20:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.56,0:20:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my father, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.07,0:20:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们走走吧  加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk with us, Gav.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他病得多重  -那个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How sick is he? - About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.33,0:20:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可能夸张了一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}we might've exaggerated a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撒谎  我们撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lied. We lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们知道你单为我们是不会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, we knew you wouldn't come if it was just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.94,0:20:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你帮忙  加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help, Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.23,0:20:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"帮忙"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Help"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.98,0:20:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-救命  -没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! - Nah, we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我们说完吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, just hear us out, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么找到...\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.65,0:20:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要对我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.12,0:20:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是想问你些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanna ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}About this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  是明星号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear God, that's The Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我的船  -本该是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's my ship! - Well, it should've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.83,0:20:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们了解它的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we know all about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.56,0:20:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们觉得你会想见一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We figured there's someone you'd wanna meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.50,0:20:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.89,0:20:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我父亲年轻时一个样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look just like my father when he was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.97,0:21:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加文  这是罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin, meet Rowena,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.49,0:21:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}your grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandmother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.15,0:21:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不可能还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't have be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,严格讲  你也不该还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, technically, dude, neither can you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.60,0:21:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.15,0:21:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲跟我说它在风暴中沉没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father told me she'd gone down in the storm
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.10,0:21:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that was the end of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你也在船上  也会一起完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end of you, too, if you'd been aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加文  你能跟我们说说其他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin, what can you tell us about the other passengers
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原本要渡洋的乘客吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}who were supposed to make the crossing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ordinary folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,店主  农夫  一个医生  一个老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storekeepers, farmers, a doctor, a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}A teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.87,0:21:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.99,0:21:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾洛维女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress Allaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.34,0:21:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是我们村大部分人的老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}She taught most of us in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.35,0:21:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是船上找到的所有东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This everyveing they found aboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.84,0:21:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  你如果认得什么告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Let us know if you recognize anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.98,0:21:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不认得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不认得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.77,0:21:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是麦卡伦先生的钩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Mr. MacCallum's hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.06,0:21:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他没有手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had no hand, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.97,0:21:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不认得\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.37,0:21:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不认得\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.35,0:22:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sweet Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.74,0:22:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是那吊坠\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the locket.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.56,0:22:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吊坠\N{\fnArial\fs30}The locket?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.51,0:22:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bought it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.55,0:22:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是给我的菲奥娜的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a gift for my Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.93,0:22:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  你还有个女朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darlin', you had a wee girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.07,0:22:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊  六个月前加入展品的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this. Added to the exhibit six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.43,0:22:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲奥娜·邓肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fiona Duncan,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.85,0:22:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的挚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}the love of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.91,0:22:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她得知我要去美国时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she found out I was going to America,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.56,0:22:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非要我带上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing would do but I take her with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.05,0:22:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉她那太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her it was too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么会在这儿  如果你没登船\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did it get here? If you didn't board the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.85,0:22:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她应该也没了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}then she wouldn't have either, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.43,0:22:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.72,0:22:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那可怕的晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}That terrible night...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.59,0:22:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正在收拾行李  准备走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was packing, ready to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.18,0:22:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲奥娜说她会来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fiona said she was going to come see me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再求我一次带上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}beg me one more time to take her along.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.51,0:22:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,显然  我没登上船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, I never made it to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.76,0:22:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么  请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that, you say? Come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.94,0:22:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我就不客气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.68,0:23:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果菲奥娜那晚来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Fiona came that night,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.92,0:23:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当时已经不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.35,0:23:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那她会以为你没带她就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she would've thought that you left without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.74,0:23:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  她肯定是自己偷偷上了船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear God, she must've smuggled herself aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.88,0:23:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她真的会做出那样的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would she really have done something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她意志很坚定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iron will, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.47,0:23:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会躲起来  直到船行驶到海上\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd have stayed hidden until they were at sea
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.54,0:23:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能调头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there was no turnin' back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.32,0:23:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那她会死掉  又愤怒又心碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she would've died, pissed as hell and heartbroken.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.57,0:23:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  未竟心愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个鬼魂大概与吊坠相连\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a ghost probably tethered to the locket.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.32,0:23:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.53,0:23:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的菲奥娜成了鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Fiona's a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.09,0:23:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这玩意在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, where is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.02,0:23:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,121号展品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Item 121.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.71,0:23:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-121  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 121? - ‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.62,0:23:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.09,0:23:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.33,0:23:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么  -它不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.97,0:24:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.83,0:24:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那杯酒...\N{\fnArial\fs30}about that drink...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.37,0:24:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.52,0:24:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sons...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.55,0:24:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信他们是很不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm... sure they're fine lads and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.15,0:24:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你最好还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it might be best if you were to...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.13,0:24:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟他们稍稍脱离一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}disengage from them a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.97,0:24:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脱离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disengage?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.21,0:24:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}This work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.89,0:24:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常辛苦  而且必须被放在首位\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's demanding and it must come first.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.40,0:24:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记录者就是我的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Men of Letters is my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.01,0:24:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.28,0:24:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我而言  没什么比我的家庭更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing comes before my family, not with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.86,0:24:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.67,0:24:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是说那是你想去相信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is that just what you want to believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.62,0:24:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟他们说话时表现得不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're different when you talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.17,0:24:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更温柔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Softer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.62,0:24:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.74,0:25:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是羞辱你  只是我的观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not an insult, just an observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.48,0:25:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你猎魔时  玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when you hunt, Mary...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.80,0:25:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我见过的最棒的之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're one of the best I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.00,0:25:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你或许会扮演好妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you might play at being the good mummy,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.90,0:25:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你深陷其中时\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when you're in the thick of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.69,0:25:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有手中的武器和空气中的血腥味\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing but a blade in your hand and blood in the air,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.96,0:25:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那才是真正的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's the real you,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.94,0:25:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最棒的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the best you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.63,0:25:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你也清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.44,0:25:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这让你非常害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think that scares the hell out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.71,0:25:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉打扰  奥乔亚博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to interrupt, Dr. Ochoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.22,0:25:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在查看沉船展品\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been looking through the shipwreck exhibit
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.88,0:25:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与凶案的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}in connection with the murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.75,0:25:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,似乎有件展品遗失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There seems to be an item missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.87,0:25:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.68,0:25:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里  121号  一个吊坠\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right here. 121. It's a locket.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.45,0:26:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能  它在封闭的展柜里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not possible. It's in a sealed case.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.84,0:26:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道  女士  但我们到处找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know, ma'am, but -- but we've looked everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.52,0:26:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's definitely gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.95,0:26:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这几天里又来过老师带队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have one of those, um, student tours been through here
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.63,0:26:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,学生参观团队吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}the last couple of days, the ones led by the teachers?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.69,0:26:13.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  昨天就有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, there was one yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.56,0:26:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where are they from?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.95,0:26:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,潘布鲁克女子日校\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Pembroke Day School for Girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.68,0:26:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(潘布鲁克女子日校)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.96,0:26:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.73,0:26:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喝杯酒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout a glass of wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.55,0:26:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我再读到一篇网上抄来的《荒凉山庄》论文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I read one more Internet-bought paper on "Bleak House,"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.00,0:26:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就要叫起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.94,0:26:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.79,0:26:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,配电盘又坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The panel?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.57,0:28:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Is it dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.38,0:28:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  死很久了  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Has been for a long time. - ‭What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.87,0:28:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那是鬼魂  -盐弹只能暂时拖住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was a ghost. - The rock salt only slowed it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.31,0:28:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得搞清楚它是不是菲奥娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we gotta figure out if this was Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.47,0:28:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, show time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.05,0:29:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不安的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}"O restless spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.33,0:29:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向我显形吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}make thy presence known to me."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.69,0:29:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲奥娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.44,0:29:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我  加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is I, Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.39,0:29:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.65,0:29:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.70,0:29:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲奥娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.40,0:29:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.42,0:29:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你抛弃了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You abandoned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.24,0:30:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你...你去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.42,0:30:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去了你家  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to your room. I --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.82,0:30:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的错  我被送去了别处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wisnae my fault. I was sent somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.73,0:30:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我躲在了明星号上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hid myself aboard The Star,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.00,0:30:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你却不在上面保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you wernnae there to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.41,0:30:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,船员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.92,0:30:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们来嘲笑我  鄙夷我\N{\fnArial\fs30}they came to scorn me and mock me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.05,0:30:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}and worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.24,0:30:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们惨无人道地蹂躏了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use me in a way no woman should be used.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.79,0:30:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他乘客\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other passengers...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.26,0:30:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人帮你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did no one help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.72,0:30:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都束手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}All did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.23,0:30:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有艾洛维女士  我们的老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mistress Allaway, our teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.70,0:30:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说我向你投怀送抱  所以活该有此下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said I deserved it for throwin' myself at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.53,0:30:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老师  他们自称爱孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teachers -- they claim to love children,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.21,0:30:48.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却背叛他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then they betray them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.46,0:30:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能惩罚她  但其他人会偿还她的孽债\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cou'dna punish her, but others will pay her debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.61,0:31:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在船上生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her life aboard that ship was so unbearable,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.11,0:31:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以她把死视为了解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}she felt death would be a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.17,0:31:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经认识的善良少女现在成了一心复仇的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the sweet maid I knew is now a spirit bent on revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.86,0:31:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都同意得阻止菲奥娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we agree Fiona has to be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.70,0:31:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能烧了她的遗骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't burn her bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.73,0:31:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那在大西洋海底呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're at the bottom of the Atlantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.71,0:31:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以毁掉吊坠  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could destroy the locket. Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.81,0:31:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她可能还跟船上其他的东西有连接\N{\fnArial\fs30}she might also be tethered to something else on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.89,0:31:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  她杀死的可怜人都无法复生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, nothing can bring back the poor people she killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.93,0:31:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实  或许有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, there might be a-a way
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.25,0:31:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,修复一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fix pretty much everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.95,0:31:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.93,0:31:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让菲奥娜不会变成鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep Fiona from going Casper in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.24,0:31:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  如果她不是愤怒孤独地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. There's no reason for her to be a ghost
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.15,0:31:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个人在船上  也就不会变鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she's not angry and alone... on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.54,0:31:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是想干扰时间流吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't intend to tamper with the flow of time do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.54,0:31:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这要看加文的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's up to Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.41,0:31:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是想找解决办法吗  这就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're lookin' for a fix here, okay? This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.71,0:31:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们让他登上船\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get him aboard that ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.72,0:32:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他跟菲奥娜一起出海  保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}he travels with Fiona, keeps her safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.90,0:32:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后死掉  这就是你们的解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And go to his death. That's your solution?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.95,0:32:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没说这个很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say it was the fun one, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.41,0:32:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是唯一的办法  你很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the one, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.12,0:32:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样历史也不会被扭曲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it would keep history intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.01,0:32:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...was thinki'' the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.74,0:32:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱她  她爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved her. She loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.23,0:32:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切发生都是因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the only reason any of this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.37,0:32:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以让她不必蒙受困住了她的噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can spare her the nightmare she's trapped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.78,0:32:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来也无法融入这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannae say I ever fit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.63,0:32:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里  我是孤独的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, I'm alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.56,0:32:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲奥娜和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fiona and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.73,0:32:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以永世在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll spend eternity together.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.64,0:32:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.27,0:32:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就因为笨蛋和笨笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just 'cause Dim and Dimmer here
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.90,0:32:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无法把自己的家人留在一个维度里\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't keep their own family all in the same dimension,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.77,0:32:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不代表他们可以动我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean they can mess with mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.23,0:32:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲  我想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, I want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.08,0:32:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要的是健身房会员卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you want is a gym membership,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.24,0:32:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猫头鹰餐厅的酒水半价时段  和小熊队门票\N{\fnArial\fs30}happy hour at Hooters, and Cubs tickets --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.31,0:33:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些都只在这里有\N{\fnArial\fs30}none of which are available anywhere else but here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.31,0:33:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.86,0:33:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么叫我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.71,0:33:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你找他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You called him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.77,0:33:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}To say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.85,0:33:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他去吧  费格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go, Fergus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.67,0:33:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别插嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Butt out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.28,0:33:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,费格斯  他跟我们不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fergus, he's not like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.64,0:33:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他有信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believes in things.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.43,0:33:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他做他认为正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him do what he believes is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.05,0:33:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.31,0:33:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.63,0:33:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.90,0:33:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.46,0:34:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(潘布鲁克女子日校)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.91,0:34:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That soup yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.75,0:34:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.64,0:34:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.96,0:34:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.26,0:34:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗  加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to do this, Gavin?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.86,0:35:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定这能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're positive this will work?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.02,0:35:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从未试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never done it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.59,0:35:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们爷爷做过  阿比顿也做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But our granddad did. And Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.19,0:35:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗威娜把咒语做了改动  好让你用\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Rowena tweaked the spell so that you could use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.89,0:35:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.40,0:35:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.63,0:35:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不好受啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.75,0:35:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个好人  加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good guy, Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.15,0:35:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.63,0:35:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.04,0:35:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是最好的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is all for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.44,0:35:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,送他去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beam him up, Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.52,0:35:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.07,0:35:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.04,0:35:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.98,0:36:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(无结果)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.29,0:36:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女校的老师都回去工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}So the teachers at the girls' school are all back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.36,0:36:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就好像什么都没发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like nothing ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.27,0:36:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,俄亥俄州的被害人都查到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all the victims in Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.90,0:36:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麻省的案子也查不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no mention of the Massachusetts murder either.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.97,0:36:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有菲奥娜  没有愤怒鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}no Fiona, no angry ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.74,0:36:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来历史归位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like history is back on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.86,0:36:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.46,0:36:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-妈妈  -哎呦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! - ‭Well, well!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.54,0:36:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭It has been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.20,0:37:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好久  好久  好久  好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long, long... long, long, long, long while.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.63,0:37:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是矫情  你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right. He's dramatic, as you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.06,0:37:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是想说  我们想你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he meant to say was, we missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.13,0:37:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.43,0:37:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汉堡包  啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burgers. Beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.34,0:37:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yum. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.21,0:37:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原谅你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.97,0:37:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都干什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatcha been up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.44,0:37:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢跑  太极  冥想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jogging, tai chi, meditation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.78,0:37:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,融化食人怪的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melting rugaru brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.84,0:37:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,融化食人怪的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-m-melting rugaru brains?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.20,0:37:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这话没法委婉地说  我就直说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no easy way to say it, so I'm just gonna say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.17,0:37:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have sort of...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.79,0:37:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在跟英国记录者合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}been working with the British Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.64,0:37:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你...什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-- You -- you, uh... you what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.55,0:37:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.09,0:37:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.18,0:38:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们跟他们有过节\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have a-a history with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.35,0:38:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.39,0:38:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个决定很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was a hard decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.94,0:38:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们在做好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're doing good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.25,0:38:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮他们救了人  很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have helped them save people, a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.81,0:38:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以向他们学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can learn from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.75,0:38:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别摆那副表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not give me the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.51,0:38:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-什么表情  -你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What face? - You know the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.80,0:38:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-没什么表情  -就是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no face. - That's the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.97,0:38:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  我们有自己的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, we have our own tool kit,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.77,0:38:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且也挺好用\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it works just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.09,0:38:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为一些明显的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-and for obvious reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.89,0:38:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如折断的肋骨  和烧伤的脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}like broken ribs and burnt feet...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.79,0:38:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不信任那些英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't trust the Brits.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.17,0:38:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where does that leave us?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.26,0:38:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和以往一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.93,0:39:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.57,0:39:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.75,0:39:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.92,0:39:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you did...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.49,0:39:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算对你  也太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A low, even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.83,0:39:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't right. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.54,0:39:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会知道什么是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you would know what's right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.89,0:39:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你有个丑陋  讨厌  恶意的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know there's an ugly, rancid, spiteful reason
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.77,0:39:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我的儿子  你的孙子  去送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}why you sent my son, your grandson, to his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.45,0:39:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.17,0:39:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a lovely boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.36,0:39:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你以你的方式在乎他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in your own lizard way, I know you cared for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.78,0:40:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我在乎奥斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as I cared for Oskar.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.49,0:40:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥斯卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oskar.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.21,0:40:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱他胜过你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The child I loved more than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.10,0:40:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为了移除该隐血印逼我杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy you made me kill in order to remove the Mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.01,0:40:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以加文做的是正确的事什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that was all drivel you were spewing
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.69,0:40:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是你瞎说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}about Gavin doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.46,0:40:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确是正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.45,0:40:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对于加文或许是的  对我绝对是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe for Gavin, certainly for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.79,0:40:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看到你蒙受丧子之痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It allowed me to watch you suffer the loss of a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.60,0:40:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.26,0:40:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你母亲  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your mother, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.76,0:40:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有谁更能碾碎你的小心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who better to crush your shriveled heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.66,0:41:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大衮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dagon.

